{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=(The Radiant Feldspar/The Trailblaze's Stern/The Tatalov/The Soaring Clock Hand)|Robin just showed up with some weird treasure &mdash; a Holy Grail that grants wishes? Man, that's awesome.}}
